{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17343","headline":"奉和郑宾客相公摄官丰陵扈从之作 · 权德舆","name":"奉和郑宾客相公摄官丰陵扈从之作","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"五辂导灵輼，千夫象缭垣。\n行宫移晓漏，彩杖下秋原。\n莫究希夷理，空怀涣汗恩。\n颐神方蹈道，传圣乃尊尊。\n共祝如山寿，俄惊凭几言。\n遐荒七月会，肸蠁百灵奔。\n豹尾从风直，鸾旗映日翻。\n涂刍联法从，营骑肃旌门。\n杳霭虞泉夕，凄清楚挽喧。\n不堪程尽处，呜咽望文园。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"权德舆","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_17343.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17343","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}